Mickey Ironroots is a dwarf and a well-regarded detective. He is a naturalistic sort, his hands stained by years of working dirt, with a big, swept-up beard and simple clothes. Around his neck hangs a necklace holding a piece of tree branch, like a small upside-down bonsai, from which he conjures a set of wooden armor.

Mickey can find water and food in wild country, and he reads the signs of animals and terrain better than most.

Mickey is a member of the [[Org/Iridescent Church/Convox/Magical Crimes/index|Magical Crimes Convox]] of the [[Org/Iridescent Church/index|Iridescent Church]].
